+/// A lightweight snapshot of the interpreter cursor and its cached reach/values.
+///
+/// It contains no tree nodes, strategies, regrets, or locks. Restore it only on the
+/// same game without rebuilding/allocating/finalizing the game or changing an
+/// ancestor's strategy. Descendant strategy edits are deliberately preserved.
